{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.66] I told her, \"Ride it like a rental, it's just a rental\"\n[00:04.16] I'm not with all the sentimentals, like a rental\n[00:06.04] I told her, \"Ride it like a rental, just keep it simple\"\n[00:07.36] Uh, I told her, \"Ride it like a rental\" (Told her, \"Ride it like a rental\")\n[00:09.16] Skrrt, skrrt, skrrt, skrrt\n[00:22.36] After this song, we finna go ride some dirt bikes?\n[00:26.18] Lit\n[00:27.46] Uh-huh, in the Hills, fucking up all the happy houses\n[Verse 1]\n[00:30.62] I told her, \"Ride it like a rental, it's just a rental\"\n[00:33.16] I'm not with all the sentimentals, just keep it simple\n[00:35.78] You wanna know what I'm into so you can get into it\n[00:38.70] I ain't tryna get into it, I done been through it\n[00:41.10] A lot shit been on my mental, I done been through it\n[00:43.86] Niggas say they gon' kill me, Nike, just do it\n[00:46.50] Bitches say they want the real me, they sound real stupid\n[00:49.48] I already told you my relationship with Cupid\n[00:51.90] This shit don't ever work, my heart cold\n[00:54.24] It's been cold since I threw it to the South Pole\n[00:57.18] Uh, AP, two-tone, yeah, my wrist cold (Uh)\n[00:59.60] Straight flawless, the brightest of crystals (Uh)\n[01:02.34] I'm a diamond in the rough, that's a gem, ho (Uh)\n[01:04.92] Got a thing for Geminis with a bad soul (Uh)\n[01:07.66] I was taught to let live and to let 'em go (Uh)\n[01:10.20] But instead, I just love 'em and hold 'em close (Uh)\n[01:13.22] Opiate addict, yeah, it's fucking Narcos (Uh)\n[01:15.46] Heartbreak addict too, I've been done wrong (Uh)\n[01:18.12] Got a thing for the freaks and the snake hoes (Uh)\n[01:20.76] Love sex so much, need a porno (Uh)\n[01:23.00] Love head so much, need a deep throat (Uh)\n[01:26.04] I can't fuck with her if she don't got a deep throat (Uh)\n[01:28.72] Hundred-fifty for the watch, not a cheapo (Uh)\n[01:31.58] Cubic zirconias, you can keep those (Uh)\n[01:35.36] Uh, see a whole different side of me, ah-ha\n[01:37.90] Need a girl that'll die for me, ah-ha\n[01:40.34] Her boyfriend want a rivalry, ah-ha\n[01:42.70] That nigga better come ride for me, ah-ha\n[01:45.94] I remember when I couldn't get they time of day, now these hoes wanna spend they time with me, ah-ha\n[01:51.22] I remember being little, playing board games, now I'm playing real-life Monopoly, ah-ha\n[Bridge]\n[01:55.68] Cha-ching\n[02:01.12] Cha-ching\n[02:06.28] Cha-ching\n[02:08.30] I wake up in the morning\n[02:09.80] With a alarm clock in my head\n[02:12.36] It's a coach whistle, and (Ayy, ayy, ayy)\n[02:14.10] Something like a cash register, uh\n[02:15.34] Yeah, uh (Cha-ching)\n[Verse 2]\n[02:17.58] I don't got to come back 'cause I never left\n[02:19.48] I could only imagine how that feels, no disrespect (Uh)\n[02:22.76] On the right track, I don't ever go left\n[02:25.06] Need my millions upfront, yeah, plus a bonus\n[02:27.66] Had a big heart, uh, 'til a nigga sold it\n[02:30.32] Had a good soul, uh, 'til a nigga sold it\n[02:32.78] We came from the same place, I made it, you stayed\n[02:35.26] They wasn't gon' hear our story 'less a real nigga told it\n[02:38.20] Took his bitch, yeah, I stole her, I'm gettin' bolder\n[02:40.68] I'm sick, nigga, no Ebola, need a Ricola\n[02:43.32] She took my heart, yeah, she stole it, and now she own it\n[02:45.96] My heartbreak on the way, I'm good for the moment\n[02:48.62] I'm Tom Hanks with the play, Forrest Gump, runnin'\n[02:51.16] I get bad news everyday, gettin' high, just in case\n[02:54.04] Fake boobs to the face, good nudes, masturbate\n[02:56.68] How rude, baddie with an attitude, give me face\n[02:59.38] Attitude, I don't like her attitude\n[03:01.30] Let her swallow, she should have a attitude of gratitude\n[03:03.94] Bullets hollow, give 'em to a nigga like a attitude\n[03:06.88] .50-shot clip for a nigga with a attitude\n[03:09.30] Rolls-Royce truck, catch me cruisin' on the avenue\n[03:11.86] Good nut bust from some head, yeah, that'll do\n[03:14.70] I ain't Mr. T, nah, I never pity fools\n[03:17.26] I see how you living, to be honest, it's pitiful\n[03:19.94] I don't like much, I'm a chill dude, dude\n[03:23.04] Complicated, but it's kinda simple-le\n[03:25.68] Call my gun Proactiv, you a pimple-le\n[03:28.32] Catch me interacting with your bitch, ooh, ooh\n[03:30.96] Walk in the room, I'm too smooth\n[03:33.58] That's not me, that's the Percs, ooh, ooh-ooh\n[03:36.54] 'Til I die, I'ma work, ooh, ooh-ooh\n[03:38.92] Had to cut down on the syrup, ooh, ooh-ooh\n[Outro]\n[03:42.56] I was sleeping away money, couldn't wake up and get money\n[03:47.82] Now I'm up tryna get money, give a fuck what they want from me\n[03:52.82] I was too heart-broke to get money\n[03:55.08] Yeah, I'm sad, but I'm no dummy\n[03:58.04] If there's anything you should take from me\n[04:00.46] It's that I'm a confused, young, rich junkie (Young, rich junkie)","words":[[1.54,1.62,"[Intro]"],[1.66,1.66,"I"],[1.7,1.86,"told"],[1.96,2.0,"her,"],[2.04,2.14,"\"Ride"],[2.22,2.24,"it"],[2.34,2.5,"like"],[2.54,2.54,"a"],[2.66,2.92,"rental,"],[3.2,3.26,"it's"],[3.3,3.5,"just"],[3.56,3.56,"a"],[3.66,3.9,"rental\""],[4.16,4.24,"I'm"],[4.32,4.42,"not"],[4.5,4.66,"with"],[4.7,4.78,"all"],[4.82,4.86,"the"],[4.96,5.58,"sentimentals,"],[5.62,5.68,"like"],[5.74,5.74,"a"],[5.9,6.0,"rental"],[6.04,6.04,"I"],[6.08,6.16,"told"],[6.22,6.26,"her,"],[6.3,6.36,"\"Ride"],[6.4,6.42,"it"],[6.46,6.52,"like"],[6.56,6.56,"a"],[6.6,6.88,"rental,"],[6.92,7.0,"just"],[7.04,7.12,"keep"],[7.16,7.18,"it"],[7.22,7.32,"simple\""],[7.36,7.38,"Uh,"],[7.42,7.42,"I"],[7.46,7.56,"told"],[7.6,7.64,"her,"],[7.68,7.76,"\"Ride"],[7.8,7.82,"it"],[7.86,7.94,"like"],[7.98,7.98,"a"],[8.02,8.14,"rental\""],[8.18,8.38,"(Told"],[8.42,8.46,"her,"],[8.5,8.64,"\"Ride"],[8.68,8.72,"it"],[8.78,8.86,"like"],[8.92,8.92,"a"],[8.96,9.12,"rental\")"],[9.16,9.26,"Skrrt,"],[9.3,11.58,"skrrt,"],[12.16,13.46,"skrrt,"],[20.66,22.32,"skrrt"],[22.36,22.48,"After"],[22.52,22.58,"thi